<title>USA: FFLC Bancorp stake held by N.Y. group.</title>
<headline>FFLC Bancorp stake held by N.Y. group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment advisor First Manhattan Co said Tuesday it has acquired a 5.2 percent stake or 135,979 common shares in FFLC Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its stake includes 15,000 shares purchased on October 21 at $18.60 a share.</p>
<p>The shares were purchased by First Save Associates L.P. and Second First Save Associates L.P., which are affiliates of First Manhattan that invest in bank securities.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stock in the Leesburg, Fla.,-based bank holding company for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
